---
description: PROGRESS.md is the canonical working memory for project continuation
alwaysApply: true
---

Before substantial continuation work:
- read root `PROGRESS.md`
- read `.ai-kit/current-task.json` when present
- verify task-critical facts in the repository
- continue the first verified unfinished item

After meaningful work:
- update `PROGRESS.md`
- record discovered bugs, debt and blockers
- record validation actually run
- set the next concrete action

Never mark work done based only on prior conversation memory.
